  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asia Pacific Forum of National Human Rights Institutions 2022-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity will provide core funding (for five years) to the Asia Pacific Forum of National Human Rights Institutions (APF) in line with their Strategic Plan to increase the number of Pacific Island Countries NHRIs and Strengthen the existing NRHRIs in the Asia-Pacific Region. The aim is to increase the accountability and transparency of Asia-Pacific Governments in meeting human rights obligations.</narrative>
  </description>
